      <h2>DTG vs. DTF vs. screen printing</h2>
      <p class="compare-intro">There is no single best method for every job. Quantity, artwork, garment fabric, deadline, and desired feel determine which process makes the most sense.</p>

      <div class="compare-table-scroll">
        <table class="compare-table">
          <caption>General comparison for custom apparel. Exact results and pricing vary by artwork, garment, placement, and production requirements.</caption>
