      <p class="compare-note" id="pricing-note">*Illustrative Image On estimates use the site's current pricing model for a standard $8 shirt with one large decoration: $25 at one piece, $18 each at 12, and $15 each at 100. Dark garments, extra placements, premium blanks, oversized artwork, special handling, taxes, and other project details can change the final quote. Image On does not quote or provide screen printing.</p>
